            <description><![CDATA[
<b>Perch for Mac</b>

<li><b>Import a bank statement</b> in the Money tab: copy the prompt into any AI chat, paste its reply, then check each line, fix categories, dates or amounts, and add.</li>
<li><b>Or let Claude do it:</b> attach a statement and ask Claude to import it into Perch. The lines open in the Money tab for you to check; nothing is added until you confirm.</li>
<li><b>Transactions:</b> search, filter by spent, received, passed through or category, and see totals for exactly what's shown: spent, received, net, average, per day, the largest, and a breakdown by category.</li>

]]></description>
